PHP 8.7 INTERNALS UPGRADE NOTES

1. Internal API changes

2. Build system changes

3. Module changes

4. OpCode changes

5. SAPI changes

========================
1. Internal API changes
========================

- Removed zend_execute_scripts(). Manually call zend_execute_script() in a loop
  instead.
- Removed ZEND_STATIC_ASSERT(). Use C11 static_assert() directly instead.
- Removed HAVE_NORETURN and HAVE_NORETURN_ALIAS. ZEND_NORETURN is guaranteed to
  work.

========================
2. Build system changes
========================

- Unix build system changes:
  . Autoconf minimum required version upgraded to 2.71.

========================
3. Module changes
========================

- Standard:
  . php_explode() now takes a HashTable* instead of a zval* to store the
    resulting parts. It already expected the zval* to be IS_ARRAY.

========================
4. OpCode changes
========================

========================
5. SAPI changes
========================
